dy><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scimitar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Scimitar_Icon.png/300px-Scimitar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f6/Scimitar_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scimitar of Cinder image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Scimitar_Icon.png/300px-Scimitar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Scimitar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF ;\">Scimitar of Cinder</span></strong> is a common, highly enchanted (+3) variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\">Scimitars</a> family of weapons. It is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">martial melee weapon</a> wielded in one hand. As a <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">finesse</a> weapon, it can benefit from the wielder's Dexterity and not just their Strength. It's a <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">light</a> weapon that anyone can dual-wield without special training.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d6 + 3 (4~9) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength or Dexterity modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Extra damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/40px-D6_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/54px-D6_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D6_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d6 (1~6)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\"><pi