 src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Strike\" title=\"Scorching Strike\">Scorching Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Lash out with a blazing strike and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burn</a> your target. </dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Fire Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Myrmidons\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Fire Myrmidon\">Fire Myrmidons</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is item cannot be obtained without exploits, because Fire Myrmidons are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/38px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/50px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanently Armed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\">Permanently Armed</a>.\n<ul><li>A previous exploit involving getting the myrmidon arrested has been patched out.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The version carried by NPC Myrmidons (as opposed to wildshape or player summons) is neither enchanted, nor deals elemental damage.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Scorching Strike:</i></p>\n<ul><li>This weapon action has no recharge time or other limitations and is strictly better than the myrmidon's standard attack.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.130 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4725/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67599/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13810/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.047/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1623692/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  113.532      1 -total\n 78.85%   89.520      1 Template:Weapon_page\n 21.81%   24.761     51 Template:Trim\n 21.11%   23.967      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 20.72%   23.520      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 20.14%   22.860      1 Template:Ambox\n 19.90%   22.599      9 Template:Uid\n 17.22%   19.555     13 Template:Icon_text\n 12.08%   13.716      8 Template:Icon_link\n  8.68%    9.859      2 Template:Damage_info\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22428-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195715 and revision id 402073. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}